ps://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/94250/image008.png\"></p>", "options_en": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "options_hi": ["a", "b", "c", "d"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>After 1<sup>st</sup> unfold,</p> <p><img width=54 height=113 id=\"Picture 2\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/94250/image009.jpg\"></p> <p>After second unfold,</p> <p><img width=104 height=113 id=\"Picture 3\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/94250/image010.jpg\"></p> <p>After the 3<sup>rd</sup> unfold</p> <p><img width=152 height=93 id=\"Picture 4\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/94250/image006.png\"></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>After 1<sup>st</sup> unfold,</p> <p><img width=54 height=113 id=\"Picture 2\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/94250/image009.jpg\"></p> <p>After second unfold,</p> <p><img width=104 height=113 id=\"Picture 3\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/94250/image010.jpg\"></p> <p>After the 3<sup>rd</sup> unfold</p> <p><img width=152 height=93 id=\"Picture 4\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/94250/image006.png\"></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Select the correct option that gives the correct water image of the give figure.</p><p><img width=193 height=182 id=\"Picture 22\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p15514/image022.png\"></p><p><img width=624 height=180 id=\"Picture 23\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p15514/image023.png\"></p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2313;&#2360; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; &#2332;&#2379; &#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2310;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2366; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2332;&#2354; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2348;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2348; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p><p><img width=\"193\" height=\"182\" id=\"Picture 22\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p15514/image022.png\"></p><p><img width=\"624\" height=\"180\" id=\"Picture 23\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p15514/image023.png\"></p>", "options_en": ["I", "II", "III", "IV"], "options_hi": ["I", "II", "III", "IV"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>The correct water image is:</p><p><img width=196 height=334 id=\"Picture 24\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p15514/image024.png\"></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>The correct water image is:</p><p><img width=196 height=334 id=\"Picture 24\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p15514/image024.png\"></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Which of the following options depicts the correct water image of the following figure? </p><p><img width=119 height=149 id=\"Drawing 1\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p18797/image002.png\"></p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2366; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2310;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2332;&#2354; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2348;&#2367;&#2306;&#2348; &#2325;&#2379; &#2342;&#2352;&#2381;&#2358;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p><p><img width=\"119\" height=\"149\" id=\"Drawing 1\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p18797/image002.png\"></p>", "options_en": ["I", "II", "III", "IV"], "options_hi": ["I", "II", "III", "IV"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Here, option <b>III</b> is the correct water image of the given figure.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Here, option <b>III</b> is the correct water image of the given figure.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A square of transparent sheet with a pattern on it is given below. Select the option which shows the pattern appeared on the sheet when the sheet is folded along the dotted line.</p><p><img width=624 height=362 id=\"Drawing 1\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p11595/image002.gif\"></p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2368;&#2330;&#2375; &#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2327;&#2366;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2346;&#2366;&#2352;&#2342;&#2352;&#2381;&#2358;&#2368; &#2358;&#2368;&#2335; &#2346;&#2376;&#2335;&#2352;&#2381;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2341; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2313;&#2360; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; &#2332;&#2379; &#2358;&#2368;&#2335; &#2346;&#2352; &#2342;&#2367;&#2326;&#2366;&#2312; &#2342;&#2375;&#2344;&#2375; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2375; &#2346;&#2376;&#2335;&#2352;&#2381;&#2344; &#2325;&#2379; &#2342;&#2352;&#2381;&#2358;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2348; &#2358;&#2368;&#2335; &#2325;&#2379; &#2348;&#2367;&#2306;&#2342;&#2368;&#2342;&#2366;&#2352; &#2352;&#2375;&#2326;&#2366; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2341; &#2350;&#2379;&#2337;&#2364; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p><p><img width=\"624\" height=\"362\" id=\"Drawing 1\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p11595/image002.gif\"></p>", "options_en": ["I", "II", "III", "IV"], "options_hi": ["I", "II", "III", "IV"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>On folding the transparent sheet along the dotted line, the circle and rhombus will be inscribed in the rectangle. The line segment will touch the intersection point of the circle and rectangle. The segments with the arrowheads will shift on the left side of the paper.</p><p>Hence, the answer is figure (IV).</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>On folding the transparent sheet along the dotted line, the circle and rhombus will be inscribed in the rectangle. The line segment will touch the intersection point of the circle and rectangle. The segments with the arrowheads will shift on the left side of the paper.</p><p>Hence, the answer is figure (IV).</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}]}